# Line endings: LF in the index and in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says (the windows-latest runner
# checks out with core.autocrlf=true). Tests read source files and match them with regexes, and the font license
# is checked by hash: a CRLF checkout must not change what they see.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched by end-of-line conversion or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff2 binary
